## Terminologies in Software Engineering

The organization of this file is primarily alphabetical.
The file will facilitate consistency is describing the requirements of the law and regulations applicable to such products and systems. 
This file is a resource for investigators who conduct inspections and investigations involving software and computerized systems. 

The terms are defined as much as possible using available standards 

